### Login de usuario
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Francisco Castro",
  "password": "12345"
}


### Registrar un usuario random
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.session.authorizationToken}}
{
    "username": "Giovanni",
    "password": "12345",
    "displayName": "Gio",
    "email": "gio@gmail.com",
    "role": "user"
}

